1
00:00:04,412 --> 00:00:06,662
(Leonard:)So, Missy, what brings you
all the way from Texas?

2
00:00:06,831 --> 00:00:09,621
Was it perhaps destiny?
I think it was destiny.

3
00:00:09,792 --> 00:00:11,882
My friend's getting married at Disneyland.

4
00:00:12,045 --> 00:00:15,335
(Howard:)Destiny, thy name is Anaheim.

5
00:00:16,799 --> 00:00:20,179
(Missy:)And I had to drop off some papers
for Shelly to sign for my dad's estate.

6
00:00:20,345 --> 00:00:23,845
The papers could've been mailed. Mom
sent you here to spy on me, didn't she?

7
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:26,305
(Missy:)I guess that's why
they call you a genius.

8
00:00:26,476 --> 00:00:29,146
(Sheldon:)They call me a genius
because I'm a genius.

9
00:00:30,021 --> 00:00:32,651
(Sheldon:)Tell Mom
that I currently weigh 165 pounds...

10
00:00:32,815 --> 00:00:35,985
(Sheldon:)...and that I'm having
regular bowel movements.

11
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:37,862
(Sheldon:)Enjoy the wedding. Goodbye.

12
00:00:38,196 --> 00:00:39,986
- Whoa, whoa.
- Whoa, whoa.

13
00:00:40,823 --> 00:00:44,073
If the wedding's not till tomorrow,
why don't you stay with us tonight?

14
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:47,204
(Missy:)Oh, I don't think so.
Shelly doesn't like company.

15
00:00:47,372 --> 00:00:51,162
(Missy:)Even as a little boy, he'd send his imaginary
friends home at the end of the day.

16
00:00:51,668 --> 00:00:54,758
(Sheldon:)They were not friends.
They were imaginary colleagues.

17
00:00:55,755 --> 00:00:58,045
(Leonard:)Look, you're here,
and we have plenty of room.

18
00:00:58,216 --> 00:01:02,026
- No, we don't.
- Come on, Shelly, she's family.

